{"url":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/tier-credits","status":200,"title":"AlFursan Tier Credits and Status Levels | Saudia","desc":"Learn how AlFursan tier credits work and how to upgrade your membership status with Saudia. Earn more benefits and privileges. Track your Saudia tier progress today.","finalUrl":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/tier-credits","bodyClass":"white-theme loyalty-offer baseLang mWebHomePage","h":2661,"sig":[{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-special-offers"],"h":850,"headings":3,"imgs":0,"text":657},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-faq"],"h":391,"headings":1,"imgs":0,"text":1290}],"h1":["AlFursan Tier Credits and Status Levels | Saudia"],"html":"<sc-placeholder _ngcontent-saudiawebapp-c260489156=\"\" name=\"jss-main\"><!----><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper rewards-header\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Tier Credits</h2><!----><p class=\"ng-star-inserted specialOffer-hd-para\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p>AlFursan loyalty program prides itself on rewarding our most frequent flyers with access to exclusive benefits. Bysimply flying with Saudia or SkyTeam partners, you can upgrade your membership to Silver, and Gold Tier. Each level comes with its own set of unique benefits and privileges, giving you even more reasons to fly with us.</p>\n<p>As a Silver or Gold member you will have access to the AlFursan lounge, additional baggage on flights, and can earn more Reward Miles, helping you redeem your next holiday faster. Access all this and so much more as an AlFursan member today.</p></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Earn and Redeem</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><a class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">About Tier Credits and Benefit</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><!----><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\" href=\"/en-SA/loyalty/about-alfursan-program/membership-tiers-benefits/membership-tiers\" target=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section rewards-faq ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Frequently asked questions</h2><!----><div class=\"all-faqs ng-star-inserted\"><a id=\"viewAllFaq\" class=\"faq_link_button ng-star-inserted\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.saudia.com/pages/help/faqs/alfursan-faq\n                  \" aria-label=\"'View all Frequently Asked Questions\"><span> View all FAQs </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined faq_icon icon-Link_chevron\"> chevron_right </span></a><!----></div><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-0 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to redeem your Miles?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"> How to redeem your Miles? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-0\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Miles can be redeemed online. Sign into your AlFursan account and select 'Redeem Miles'. Alternatively you can redeem Rewards through the Saudia Guest Care Center.\n<br>\n</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to upgrade using your Miles?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"> How to upgrade using your Miles? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-2\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Through <a href=\"https://www.saudia.com/\">www.saudia.com</a>, under 'manage', insert your booking reference and last name. Then log in with your frequent flyer program to be able to upgrade using your Miles.\n<br></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to add a family member to your account? \" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"> How to add a family member to your account?  </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-4\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>To enroll family members, you have to be the head of the Family program and then follow the below steps:</p>\n<ol>\n    <li>Log into your profile</li>\n    <li>Choose the family program section</li>\n    <li>Click on \"manage my family program\"</li>\n    <li>Click on \"add member\"</li>\n    <li>You have two options (Adding a child or adding an adult)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>* Child: Has to be 2-12 years old.Fill the mandatory field(s) to enroll a new child on the program</p>\n<p>* Adult: Has to be an existing member of AlFursan.</p>\n<ol>\n    <li>Fill the mandatory fields</li>\n    <li>Click on the send button</li>\n    <li>The request will be reviewed by the Guest Call Center. If all the information is correct, they will submit an invitation to the invited member</li>\n    <li>The invited member will accept the invitation</li>\n</ol>\n<br>\n</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to claim missing Miles?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> How to claim missing Miles? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ol>\n    <li>Log into your AlFursan profile</li>\n    <li>Choose the Miles claim section</li>\n    <li>Fill the mandatory fields</li>\n    <li>Submit the claim</li>\n</ol>\n<br></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}